ws/stanley-kubricks-personal-archive-is-going-up-for-auction-including-the-ax-from-the-shining-and-the-star-child-from-2001-a-space-odyssey-180989632/</guid></item><item><title>研究人员可能首次直接观测到系外行星的磁场，为更深入地观察遥远世界带来了希望</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-may-have-directly-glimpsed-an-exoplanets-magnetic-field-for-the-first-time-building-hope-of-peering-deeper-into-faraway-worlds-180989633/</link><description>绘架座β b 发出的无线电信号表明这颗年轻而巨大的系外行星拥有强大的磁场和强烈的极光表演</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:07:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-may-have-directly-glimpsed-an-exoplanets-magnetic-field-for-the-first-time-building-hope-of-peering-deeper-into-faraway-worlds-180989633/</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯抗鼠疫实验室员工死于肺炎，引发人们对黑死病背后疾病的担忧。以下是您需要了解的内容</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/employee-of-a-russian-anti-plague-lab-dies-of-pneumonia-sparking-concerns-over-the-disease-behind-the-black-death-heres-what-to-know-180989630/</link><description>其肺炎的官方病因尚未得到证实，俄罗斯卫生官员表示，死者的密切接触者中没有一人鼠疫检测呈阳性。肺鼠疫是一种罕见且致命的疾病</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/employee-of-a-russian-anti-plague-lab-dies-of-pneumonia-sparking-concerns-over-the-disease-behind-the-black-death-heres-what-to-know-180989630/</guid></item><item><title>就像神话中的凤凰一样，这颗行星可能是从死星的灰烬中崛起的</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/like-a-mythical-phoenix-this-planet-may-have-risen-from-the-ashes-of-a-dead-star-180989628/</link><description>根据望远镜数据预测的“第二代”世界可能是同类中第一颗已知的行星，它可能会为我们太阳系的未来带来光明</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:22:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/like-a-mythical-phoenix-this-planet-may-have-risen-from-the-ashes-of-a-dead-star-180989628/</guid></item><item><title>2100 年前，一艘载有成堆古代餐具的船在土耳其海岸沉没。其陶瓷货物仍然完好无损</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-sh